{"id":770,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"This Pokémon lives on beaches, but it hates water. Palossand can’t maintain its castle-like shape if it gets drenched by a heavy rain."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Palossand is known as the Beach Nightmare. It pulls its prey down into the sand by controlling the sand itself, and then it sucks out their souls."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Once it has whipped up a sandstorm to halt its opponents in their tracks, this terrifying Pokémon snatches away their vitality."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Each of its grains of sand has its own will. Palossand eats small Pokémon and siphons away their vital essence while they’re still alive."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Buried beneath the castle are masses of dried-up bones from those whose vitality it has drained."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Possessed people controlled by this Pokémon transformed its sand mound into a castle. As it evolved, its power to curse grew ever stronger."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Water Compaction","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Defense stat sharply when the Pokémon is hit by a Water-type move."},{"name":"Sand Veil","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's evasiveness in a sandstorm."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Brown","shape":"Squiggle","evolution":{"id":769,"name":"Sandygast","condition":null,"children":[{"id":770,"name":"Palossand","condition":"Lv. 42","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,71],[1,106],[1,310],[1,328],[15,72],[20,28],[25,523],[30,95],[35,202],[40,334],[47,247],[54,414],[61,659],[68,201]],"machine":[133,34,523,886,109,174,414,89,203,412,263,430,374,202,416,356,506,63,286,334,341,189,101,220,809,182,94,240,156,157,317,328,201,184,815,247,285,214,188,180,446,444,164,241,851,271],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv8-91","name":"Palossand ex","set":"Surging Sparks","date":"2024-11-08","rarity":"